  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Researching negative effects of reciprocal radicalisation in BiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is aimed at providing a comprehensive analysis of causes and patterns of reciprocal radicalisation in BiH. The goal is  to engage relevant stakeholders and establish a network experts in researching this dangerous phenomenon and devising tools for countering it.</narrative>
  </description>
